omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z84miaTDI60Q7kNvwEqtR8B&_nc_oc=AdoWfGz_5-iSzgHEi1T_TXCjT_mXFQvh9NtdlWSMQo_E20XC4Mff99CuKSgS-nU1WnU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyrpcZfQZcmWee3pEPpW1MqfvOndGZQ217_ul1aqlgrfA&oe=69C516F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rHne70BI508Q7kNvwEevsRl&_nc_oc=Adov3de8C-QoWMTVrDaoe7Ni7nDTsDF7eQ8stp4WB3ePXnOcg9TqhrxuDJbkKnCWexs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzxa2x7LqBwzVHpdoC2kVarAtk-dbXD6aN0eFIt8qQkVw&oe=69C51856"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vhOsC8jRzgEQ7kNvwEoBXxE&_nc_oc=Adrb6lyKiwFWjiMbUlCT6sf3Ww1HAth0u_kL4msw2-pSwxpq7FJlyHvO-c_lsniuiyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxORrFRJOA7RGQeZvIDuEOu3ZjvmPizmMJ1M25pzppHLg&oe=69C52D77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://